msgstr "Stoga ona nije funkcija, a svaka tačka na ovoj pravoj ima osobinu <p>x = "

#: lines.cpp:144
msgid "The equation of the line going through the given points is:<p>"
msgstr "Jednačina prave koja prolazi kroz zadate tačke je:<p>"

#: lines.cpp:166 lines.cpp:203
msgid ""
"<font color=red size=+1><b>Incorrect format!</b></font> <p> Enter points "
"like <b><i>(x<sub>1</sub>|x<sub>2</sub>)</i></b>"
msgstr ""
"<font color=red size=+1><b>Neispravan format!</b></font> <p> Unesite tačke "
"u obliku <b><i>(x<sub>1</sub>|x<sub>2</sub>)</i></b>"

#: lines.cpp:183
msgid ""
"The line, with the given rising which going through the given point , has "
"got the equation:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Prava sa zadatim usponom koja prolazi kroz zadatu tačku ima "
"jednačinu:\n"
"\n"

#: lines.cpp:218
msgid ""
"The line with the given equation is parallel to the x-axis, so it does not "
"intersect it.<br>"
msgstr ""
"Prava sa zadatom jednačinom je paralelna x osi, tako da je ne "
"presijeca.<br>"

#: lines.cpp:219
msgid "The y-axis is intersected at <p>S( 0 | "
msgstr "y-osa je presječena na <p>S( 0 | "

#: lines.cpp:227
msgid "The given line crosses the <b>x-axis</b> at<br>"
msgstr "Zadata prava presijeca <b>x-osu</b> na<br>"

#: lines.cpp:228
msgid " | 0 ) and the <b>y-axis</b> at \n"
msgstr " | 0 ) i <b>y-osu</b> na \n"

#: lines.cpp:235
msgid ""
"<font color=red size=+1><b>Incorrect format!</b></font> <p>Enter equation as "
"<b><i>m*x+b</i></b> using numbers for m and b. <br>So for b equal to 0 and m "
"equal to 1, enter the equation as: <b><i>1*x+0</i></b>, and not: <b><i>x</"
"i></b>."
msgstr ""
"<font color=red size=+1><b>Neispravan format!</b></font> <p>Unesite jednačine "
"u obliku <b><i>m*x+b</i></b> koristeći brojeve za m i b. <br>Tako za b jednako 0 "
"i m jednako 1, unesite jednačinu: <b><i>1*x+0</i></b>, a ne: <b><i>x</i></b>."

#: lines.cpp:253
msgid ""
"The two given lines are identical, so there is an infinite number of "
"intersecting points."
msgstr ""
"Dvije zadate prave su identične, tako da postoji beskonačan broj "
"presječnih tačaka."

#: lines.cpp:257
msgid "The two given lines are parallel, so there are no intersecting points."
msgstr "Dvije zadate prave su paralelne, tako da nema presječnih tačaka."

#: lines.cpp:266
msgid "The point of intersection of the two given lines is<p>S( "
msgstr "Tačka presjecanja dvije zadate prave je <p>S( "

#: lines.cpp:272
msgid ""
"<font color=red size=+1><b>Incorrect format!</b></font> <p>Enter equation "
"like <b><i>m*x+b</i></b> and use numbers for m and b. <br>Even 0 as addend "
"or 1 as factor should be used at first, e.g. <b><i>1*x+0</i></b> instead of "
"<b><i>x</i></b>"
msgstr ""
"<font color=red size=+1><b>Neispravan format!</b></font> <p>Unesite jednačine "
"u obliku <b><i>m*x+b</i></b> koristeći brojeve za m i b. <br>Čak i kad je 0 "
"adend ili 1 faktor, morate ih navesti npr. <b><i>1*x+0</i></b>, a ne: "
"<b><i>x</i></b>."

